  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>FIFA Online 4 / FC Online Power Shot Macro

This macro performs the initial F+D input sequence required for a Power Shot with a single key press. The green gauge timing is intentionally left manual, allowing players to adjust their shot timing and perform follow-up actions or cancel plays more flexibly.
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы 

F+D power shot macro 

The in-game key settings are the default settings.

This macro allows you to initiate a Power Shot with a single key.

The green gauge timing and follow-up actions were intentionally not included to allow for more flexible play.

After activating the macro, press D when the gauge reaches the green zone.

You can also use keys such as E or C after pressing F, making Power Shot cancel plays easier to perform.
</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 9 1
Delay 80 ms
KeyDown 7 1
Delay 300 ms
KeyUp 7 1
KeyUp 9 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>FIFA 4 Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
